      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to ${(2{a}^{-3})}^{4}?$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(2{a}^{-3})}^{4} & = \\\\ {2}^{4}{({a}^{-3})}^{4} & = \\\\ 16\\cdot {a}^{-3\\cdot 4} & = \\\\ 16{a}^{-12} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
