      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to ${(2{s}^{-1}{t}^{2})}^{4}?$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(2{s}^{-1}{t}^{2})}^{4} & = \\\\ {2}^{4}\\cdot {({s}^{-1})}^{4}\\cdot {({t}^{2})}^{4} & = \\\\ {2}^{4}\\cdot {s}^{-1\\cdot 4}\\cdot {t}^{2\\cdot 4} & = \\\\ 16{s}^{-4}{t}^{8} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
